  "description": "ASGL2 is a small cross-platform 2D game library for .NET 10 built on SDL2: the same game runs on Windows and Linux. Fixed-step game loop and game states, sprites and sprite sheets, tile maps (with a JSON map format and animated tiles), camera and parallax, particle effects, waypoints, input, sound effects and streamed music, embedded assets, a retained-mode UI toolkit and a software 3D renderer. Fully documented in Markdown inside the package (docs/, with an llms.txt index for AI coding assistants). The SDL2 native libraries are NOT included, see the package readme.",
